<!DOCTYPE html>
<html lang="en">
<head>
  <meta charset="UTF-8" />
  <meta name="viewport" content="width=device-width, initial-scale=1.0" />
  <meta http-equiv="X-UA-Compatible" content="IE=edge" />
  <title>Jim Desmond for Congress</title>

  <style>
    * {
      margin: 0;
      padding: 0;
      box-sizing: border-box;
    }

    body {
      background-color: #0D1F3C;
      font-family: Georgia, 'Times New Roman', serif;
      color: #FFFFFF;
      margin: 0;
      padding: 0;
    }

    .email-wrapper {
      background-color: #0D1F3C;
      width: 100%;
      padding: 30px 0;
    }

    .email-container {
      max-width: 620px;
      margin: 0 auto;
      background-color: #0D1F3C;
    }

    /* =====================================================
       HEADER — IMAGE BLENDED INTO EMAIL BACKGROUND
    ===================================================== */

    .header {
      position: relative;
      overflow: hidden;
      background-color: #0D1F3C;
      padding: 0;
      margin: 0;
      line-height: 0;
      font-size: 0;
    }

    .header img {
      display: block;
      width: 100%;
      max-width: 620px;
      height: auto;
      margin: 0 auto;
      padding: 0;
      border: 0;
    }

    /*
      Four-sided navy overlay.
      This fades the hard image boundaries into the
      exact same navy used throughout the email.
    */
    .header-blend {
      position: absolute;
      top: 0;
      right: 0;
      bottom: 0;
      left: 0;
      pointer-events: none;

      background:
        linear-gradient(
          to right,
          #0D1F3C 0%,
          rgba(13,31,60,0.90) 2%,
          rgba(13,31,60,0.62) 5%,
          rgba(13,31,60,0.28) 9%,
          rgba(13,31,60,0) 15%,
          rgba(13,31,60,0) 85%,
          rgba(13,31,60,0.28) 91%,
          rgba(13,31,60,0.62) 95%,
          rgba(13,31,60,0.90) 98%,
          #0D1F3C 100%
        ),
        linear-gradient(
          to bottom,
          #0D1F3C 0%,
          rgba(13,31,60,0.68) 3%,
          rgba(13,31,60,0.28) 7%,
          rgba(13,31,60,0) 13%,
          rgba(13,31,60,0) 72%,
          rgba(13,31,60,0.25) 81%,
          rgba(13,31,60,0.60) 90%,
          rgba(13,31,60,0.92) 97%,
          #0D1F3C 100%
        );
    }

    /* =====================================================
       ALERT BANNER
    ===================================================== */

    .alert-banner {
      background-color: #B22234;
      color: #FFFFFF;
      text-align: center;
      padding: 11px 20px;
      font-size: 11px;
      font-weight: bold;
      letter-spacing: 1.5px;
      text-transform: uppercase;
      font-family: Arial, sans-serif;
      margin: 0;
      border: 0;
    }

    /* =====================================================
       NATIONAL STAKES BANNER
    ===================================================== */

    .stakes-banner {
      background-color: #132845;
      border-top: 2px solid #C9A227;
      border-bottom: 2px solid #C9A227;
      padding: 14px 30px;
      text-align: center;
      margin: 0;
    }

    .stakes-banner-text {
      color: #FFFFFF;
      font-size: 13px;
      font-weight: bold;
      letter-spacing: 1px;
      font-family: Arial, sans-serif;
      text-transform: uppercase;
    }

    .stakes-banner-sub {
      color: #C9A227;
      font-size: 11px;
      margin-top: 4px;
      font-family: Arial, sans-serif;
      letter-spacing: 0.5px;
    }

    /* =====================================================
       BODY
    ===================================================== */

    .body-content {
      padding: 38px 44px;
    }

    .greeting {
      font-size: 16px;
      color: #FFFFFF;
      margin-bottom: 20px;
      font-family: Georgia, serif;
    }

    .body-text {
      font-size: 15px;
      color: #D0DFF0;
      line-height: 1.85;
      margin-bottom: 18px;
      font-family: Georgia, serif;
    }

    /* =====================================================
       NUMBERED ITEMS
    ===================================================== */

    .numbered-list {
      margin: 22px 0;
    }

    .numbered-item {
      background-color: #132845;
      border-left: 4px solid #C9A227;
      padding: 16px 20px;
      margin-bottom: 12px;
      border-radius: 0 4px 4px 0;
    }

    .numbered-item-num {
      color: #C9A227;
      font-weight: bold;
      font-size: 17px;
      font-family: Arial, sans-serif;
    }

    .numbered-item-text {
      color: #D0DFF0;
      font-size: 14px;
      margin-top: 5px;
      line-height: 1.7;
      font-family: Georgia, serif;
    }

    /* =====================================================
       CONSEQUENCE BOX
    ===================================================== */

    .consequence-box {
      background-color: #1A0A0A;
      border: 1px solid #B22234;
      padding: 18px 22px;
      margin: 22px 0;
      border-radius: 4px;
    }

    .consequence-label {
      color: #B22234;
      font-size: 10px;
      font-weight: bold;
      letter-spacing: 2px;
      text-transform: uppercase;
      font-family: Arial, sans-serif;
      margin-bottom: 8px;
    }

    .consequence-text {
      color: #FFFFFF;
      font-size: 14px;
      line-height: 1.8;
      font-family: Georgia, serif;
    }

    /* =====================================================
       EMPHASIS BOX
    ===================================================== */

    .emphasis-box {
      border-left: 4px solid #C9A227;
      background-color: #0E2240;
      padding: 18px 22px;
      margin: 22px 0;
    }

    .emphasis-text {
      color: #FFFFFF;
      font-style: italic;
      font-size: 15px;
      line-height: 1.85;
      font-family: Georgia, serif;
    }

    /* =====================================================
       DEADLINE BOX
    ===================================================== */

    .deadline-box {
      background-color: #B22234;
      border: 2px solid #FFFFFF;
      padding: 14px 20px;
      text-align: center;
      margin: 26px 0 20px;
      border-radius: 4px;
    }

    .deadline-text {
      color: #FFFFFF;
      font-size: 14px;
      font-weight: bold;
      letter-spacing: 1.5px;
      font-family: Arial, sans-serif;
      text-transform: uppercase;
    }

    /* =====================================================
       CTA
    ===================================================== */

    .cta-wrapper {
      text-align: center;
      margin: 26px 0 32px;
    }

    .cta-button {
      display: inline-block;
      background-color: #C9A227;
      color: #0D1F3C !important;
      text-decoration: none;
      padding: 17px 40px;
      font-size: 15px;
      font-weight: bold;
      letter-spacing: 2px;
      text-transform: uppercase;
      border-radius: 4px;
      font-family: Arial, sans-serif;
    }

    .cta-secondary {
      text-align: center;
      margin-top: 10px;
    }

    .cta-secondary a {
      color: #8AA0BF;
      font-size: 12px;
      font-family: Arial, sans-serif;
      text-decoration: underline;
    }

    /* =====================================================
       DIVIDER
    ===================================================== */

    .divider {
      border: none;
      border-top: 1px solid #1E3A5F;
      margin: 28px 0;
    }

    /* =====================================================
       SIGNATURE
    ===================================================== */

    .signature-name {
      font-size: 18px;
      font-weight: bold;
      color: #C9A227;
      font-family: Arial, sans-serif;
      margin-top: 6px;
    }

    .signature-title {
      font-size: 12px;
      color: #8AA0BF;
      font-family: Arial, sans-serif;
      margin-top: 3px;
    }

    /* =====================================================
       FLAG STRIP
    ===================================================== */

    .flag-strip-red {
      background-color: #B22234;
      height: 5px;
    }

    .flag-strip-white {
      background-color: #FFFFFF;
      height: 5px;
    }

    .flag-strip-navy {
      background-color: #0D1F3C;
      height: 5px;
      border-top: 1px solid #1E3A5F;
    }

    /* =====================================================
       FOOTER
    ===================================================== */

    .footer {
      background-color: #071525;
      padding: 26px 40px;
      text-align: center;
    }

    .footer-text {
      font-size: 11px;
      color: #556E8A;
      line-height: 1.7;
      font-family: Arial, sans-serif;
    }

    .footer-link {
      color: #8AA0BF;
      text-decoration: underline;
    }

    /* =====================================================
       MOBILE
    ===================================================== */

    @media only screen and (max-width: 640px) {

      .email-wrapper {
        padding: 0;
      }

      .body-content {
        padding: 26px 22px;
      }

      .header {
        padding: 0;
      }

      .footer {
        padding: 22px 20px;
      }

      .cta-button {
        display: block;
        padding: 16px 20px;
      }

      .header-blend {
        background:
          linear-gradient(
            to right,
            #0D1F3C 0%,
            rgba(13,31,60,0.70) 3%,
            rgba(13,31,60,0.20) 8%,
            rgba(13,31,60,0) 13%,
            rgba(13,31,60,0) 87%,
            rgba(13,31,60,0.20) 92%,
            rgba(13,31,60,0.70) 97%,
            #0D1F3C 100%
          ),
          linear-gradient(
            to bottom,
            #0D1F3C 0%,
            rgba(13,31,60,0.30) 5%,
            rgba(13,31,60,0) 12%,
            rgba(13,31,60,0) 74%,
            rgba(13,31,60,0.55) 90%,
            #0D1F3C 100%
          );
      }
    }
  </style>
</head>

<body>

<div class="email-wrapper">

  <div class="email-container">

    <!-- ===================================================
         HEADER
    ==================================================== -->

    <div class="header">

      <img
        src="https://www.myimgcloud.com/a1837d5d-0180-4b77-a3dd-085510fde9be.png"
        alt="Private Message from Jim Desmond"
        width="620"
        style="
          display:block;
          width:100%;
          max-width:620px;
          height:auto;
          margin:0 auto;
          padding:0;
          border:0;
        "
      />

      <div class="header-blend"></div>

    </div>

    <!-- ===================================================
         ALERT BANNER
    ==================================================== -->

    <div class="alert-banner">
      🚨 &nbsp; BREAKING: DEMOCRATS ARE TARGETING CA-48 TO FLIP THE HOUSE &nbsp; 🚨
    </div>

    <!-- ===================================================
         NATIONAL STAKES BANNER
    ==================================================== -->

    <div class="stakes-banner">

      <div class="stakes-banner-text">
        The House Majority Is On The Line
      </div>

    </div>

    <!-- ===================================================
         BODY
    ==================================================== -->

    <div class="body-content">

      <p class="greeting">
        ${Recipient.FIRST_NAME},
      </p>

      <p class="body-text">
        I have to be straight with you. I just got off the phone with our national team,
        and
        <strong style="color:#FFFFFF;">
          what I'm about to tell you is serious.
        </strong>
      </p>

      <p class="body-text">
        <strong style="color:#FFFFFF;">
          Three urgent updates from the front lines:
        </strong>
      </p>

      <!-- NUMBERED ITEMS -->

      <div class="numbered-list">

        <div class="numbered-item">

          <div class="numbered-item-num">
            1.
          </div>

          <div class="numbered-item-text">

            Democrats have placed

            <strong style="color:#FFFFFF;">
              my race on their national priority target list.
            </strong>

            DNC operatives from across the country are already arriving in our district with one mission:
            flip this seat and take back the House.

          </div>

        </div>

        <div class="numbered-item">

          <div class="numbered-item-num">
            2.
          </div>

          <div class="numbered-item-text">

            <strong style="color:#FFFFFF;">
              National left-wing dark money groups have begun reserving TV ad time
            </strong>

            to flood CA-48 with constant attacks.

            This is not a local fight, it is a fully funded attack coordinated from Washington, D.C.

          </div>

        </div>

        <div class="numbered-item">

          <div class="numbered-item-num">
            3.
          </div>

          <div class="numbered-item-text">

            If Democrats flip this seat,

            <strong style="color:#FFFFFF;">
              they could flip the entire House.
            </strong>

            And if Hakeem Jeffries becomes Speaker, the America First agenda,
            securing the border, cutting spending, and restoring American strength, is

            <strong style="color:#FFFFFF;">
              dead on arrival.
            </strong>

          </div>

        </div>

      </div>

      <!-- CONSEQUENCE BOX -->

      <div class="consequence-box">

        <div class="consequence-label">
          ⚠ What Happens If We Lose
        </div>

        <p class="consequence-text">
          Open borders. Out-of-control spending. Radical policies rammed through Congress.
          This is not hypothetical, it is their stated plan.
        </p>

      </div>

      <!-- PULL QUOTE -->

      <div class="emphasis-box">

        <p class="emphasis-text">
          "And, ${Recipient.FIRST_NAME}, this race is where the battle for the House Majority is being decided.
          The Left knows it — that's why they're sending everything they have directly at us."
        </p>

      </div>

      <p class="body-text">

        I'll be honest: I'm behind where I need to be to match what the Democrat machine
        is pouring into this race.

        But I've seen what happens when Americans like you,
        ${Recipient.FIRST_NAME}, show up.

        <strong style="color:#FFFFFF;">
          It changes everything.
        </strong>

      </p>

      <p class="body-text">
        So, can you stand with me before midnight tonight?
      </p>

      <!-- DEADLINE -->

      <div class="deadline-box">

        <div class="deadline-text">
          ⏰ &nbsp; Deadline: Tonight at 11:59 PM
        </div>

      </div>

      <!-- CTA -->

      <div class="cta-wrapper">

        <a
          href="#DONATION_LINK"
          class="cta-button"
        >
          Defend the House, Rush Support Now &rsaquo;&rsaquo;
        </a>

      </div>

      <div class="cta-secondary">

        <a href="#DONATION_LINK">
          Or chip in any amount to keep CA-48 red &rsaquo;
        </a>

      </div>

      <hr class="divider" />

      <!-- SIGNATURE -->

      <p
        class="body-text"
        style="margin-bottom:6px;"
      >
        Fighting for America,
      </p>

      <p class="signature-name">
        Jim Desmond
      </p>

      <p class="signature-title">
        Candidate for Congress, CA-48
      </p>

    </div>

    <!-- ===================================================
         FLAG STRIP
    ==================================================== -->

    <div class="flag-strip-red"></div>

    <div class="flag-strip-white"></div>

    <div class="flag-strip-navy"></div>

    
